    "eventDetail": "<p>This event is designed for those interested in improving care for patient who are difficult to resuscitate, especially if your facility: </p>\r\n<p>·      Uses mechanical circulatory support (ECLS or ECMO), and is interested in expanding to treat cardiac arrest</p>\r\n<p>·      Already uses mechanical circulatory support for cardiac arrest, but would benefit from learning operational strategies for improving outcomes</p>\r\n<p>·      Does not yet use mechanical circulatory support, but is interested in developing an ECMO program for cardiac arrest resuscitation</p>\r\n",
